From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JSBedded <noreply@jsbedded.invalid>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add CONFIG_NO_TM_GMTOFF

Local-only (not sent upstream yet): newlib (pico-sdk, ESP-IDF) has no
struct tm member tm_gmtoff, so getTimezoneOffset() does not compile.
CONFIG_NO_TM_GMTOFF uses the gmtime()/mktime() path upstream already
has for Windows.
---
 quickjs.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/quickjs.c b/quickjs.c
--- a/quickjs.c
+++ b/quickjs.c
@@ -47251,7 +47251,7 @@ static int getTimezoneOffset(int64_t time)
         }
     }
     ti = time;
-#if defined(_WIN32)
+#if defined(_WIN32) || defined(CONFIG_NO_TM_GMTOFF)
     {
         struct tm *tm;
         time_t gm_ti, loc_ti;
-- 
